-- #157: the demo's chapters are each discipline's first two topics, so those must be topics. In 39 demo disciplines they
-- were not: headers and notes ("Conteúdo teórico:", "Apresentação", "Parte do conteúdo será desenvolvido em atividades
-- de extensão"), lines a PDF broke in two, and one-line ementas that made a one-chapter book (owner, 2026-11-27).
-- Each list keeps the program's own words: lines dropped, joined, or split where the ementa lists several ideas;
-- 1335's "program" is a list of credited activities, so its topics are null and its subject is not played.
-- Each row changes only while it still holds the list this was written from (its md5).

